    ``InheritableThreadLocal``, or thread local such as tags
    with Spark Connect.

    When the pinned thread mode is off, this works as :class:`threading.Thread`.

    .. versionadded:: 3.1.0

    .. versionchanged:: 3.5.0
        Supports Spark Connect.

